  "question": {
    "text": "Let $f(x)=\\frac{2^{x+2}+16}{2^{2 x+1}+2^{x+4}+32}$. Then the value of $8\\left(f\\left(\\frac{1}{15}\\right)+f\\left(\\frac{2}{15}\\right)+\\ldots+f\\left(\\frac{59}{15}\\right)\\right)$ is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
